{"title": "Sydney Swans Club Future Uncertain After Player Suspensions", "summary": "The Sydney Swans have suspended several players, a decision that has reportedly \"torpedoed\" their premiership campaign. The club has \"abandoned the old-school script,\" and the \"future\" of the club is now uncertain. Some suspended players have broken their silence following the club's decision.", "summary_points": ["Sydney Swans have suspended players.", "The decision has impacted their premiership campaign.", "The club's future is described as uncertain.", "Some suspended players have spoken out."], "title_hi": "सिडनी स्वान्स क्लबचे भविष्य खेळाडूंच्या निलंबनानंतर अनिश्चित", "summary_hi": "सिडनी स्वान्सने अनेक खेळाडूंना निलंबित केले आहे, हा निर्णय कथितरित्या त्यांच्या प्रीमियरशिप मोहिमेला \"धक्का\" देणारा आहे. क्लबने \"जुनी पद्धत सोडली\" आहे आणि क्लबचे \"भविष्य\" आता अनिश्चित आहे. काही निलंबित खेळाडूंनी क्लबच्या निर्णयानंतर आपले मौन सोडले आहे.", "summary_points_hi": ["सिडनी स्वान्सने खेळाडूंना निलंबित केले आहे.", "या निर्णयाचा त्यांच्या प्रीमियरशिप मोहिमेवर परिणाम झाला आहे.", "क्लबचे भविष्य अनिश्चित असल्याचे वर्णन केले आहे.", "काही निलंबित खेळाडूंनी यावर भाष्य केले आहे."], "framing": {}, "framing_hi": {}, "topic": "Society", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "", "sources": [{"source": "The Sydney Morning Herald", "owner": "The Sydney Morning Herald", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "The Swans abandoned the old-school script. What happens next will shape the club’s future"}, {"source": "The Age", "owner": "The Age", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "The Swans abandoned the old-school script. What happens next will shape the club’s future"}, {"source": "The Age", "owner": "The Age", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxOUHA1SHdiaVRRX1pOWUdBZUhhbUdqc3lad2xJT3BvRWtqYlVHdFBlYy1LY2hDNlowdGZLY1NZNEkyR3hUY1